{'symbol': 'CBRE', 'date': '2019-10-14 22:30:00', 'title': 'CBRE APPOINTS CHRIS BRETT AS MANAGING DIRECTOR OF ITS EMEA CAPITAL MARKETS', 'text': 'CBRE HAS APPOINTED CHRIS BRETT AS MANAGING DIRECTOR OF ITS EMEA CAPITAL MARKETS. BRETT WILL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR LEADING CBRE’S CAPITAL MARKETS BUSINESS ACROSS THE REGION AND WORK ALONGSIDE THE EXISTING TEAMS IN THE UK AND IN CONTINENTAL EUROPE. HE WILL SUCCEED ADOLFO RAMIREZ-ESCUDERO, WHO WILL NOW FOCUS ON LEADING CBRE’S SPANISH BUSINESS.'}